# Engine-local ignores only.
#
# Tree-wide rules (target/, .DS_Store, graphify-out/, *.rs.bk, Cargo.lock.orig,
# editor scratch) live in the ROOT .gitignore and already apply here. Do not
# restate them: two copies drift, and the copy you edit is never the one git read.

# Regression / run artifacts.
/artifacts
/out
*.npy
*.bin.tmp

# Do NOT ignore Cargo.lock — this is an application workspace, lockfile is committed.
# (No parent rule ignores it today; this negation is a guard against one being added.)
!Cargo.lock

# Audit reports — local working artefacts, not part of the shipped repo.
audit_reports/

#golden_scenes
ppf-cts-gauge/

notes_to_human.md
